#   Engineers to SaaS: not converted: destination group SaaS-Domains: a destination group of FQDNs (DSTN_FQDN), which the model does not hold; not converted: groups Engineering; references 'SaaS-Domains': a destination group of FQDNs (DSTN_FQDN), which the model does not hold; the source of the rule is in zone HQ-Brussels
#   No embargoed countries: not converted: destination countries COUNTRY_KP
#   Printers syslog: the source of the rule is in zone HQ-Brussels, Branch-Ghent, HQ-Servers, Guest-WiFi, road-warrior, and a rule of Google Cloud names no zone: give the networks behind HQ-Brussels, Branch-Ghent, Guest-WiFi, road-warrior with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone internet, and a rule o
#   Infra out: the source of the rule is in zone HQ-Brussels, Branch-Ghent, HQ-Servers, Guest-WiFi, road-warrior, and a rule of Google Cloud names no zone: give the networks behind HQ-Brussels, Branch-Ghent, Guest-WiFi, road-warrior with --zone-network; the destination of the rule is in zone internet, and a rule o
